#note "ATOXDSCL populated, ATOXGRL empty -> violation"
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col ATOXGRL type=Char
col ATOXDSCL type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | 5 |  | Grade 2 low
